# Fixed inputs for the delivery binary and the Gate 0 probes.
#
# These are the values recorded in the v0.4.3 release receipt
# (pins.txt). Changing one is a deliberate act: update this file, rebuild,
# and record the new receipt. The build no longer follows a fork branch head,
# so two builds of the same commit compile the same sources.
#
# PIN_XRAY_VERSION is probe-only: Xray is not linked into the Caddy binary.

